            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/a540542c9e4e836390bfb24a25c205bf.poster.avif?t=1792718193\" width=700 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/a540542c9e4e836390bfb24a25c205bf.webm?t=1792718193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/a540542c9e4e836390bfb24a25c205bf.mp4?t=1792718193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/94748cbaeec0ad3090ce509567b709e9.poster.avif?t=1792718193\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/94748cbaeec0ad3090ce509567b709e9.webm?t=1792718193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/94748cbaeec0ad3090ce509567b709e9.mp4?t=1792718193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ATERRA,</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explora uma seleção de mapas em permanente crescimento e transformação que te vai desafiar constantemente. Vais escolher as periferias mais seguras e arriscar não conseguir saque suficiente ou optarás por aterrar em zonas de conflito nas cidades densas e lutar mal toques no chão? Cada partida é diferente, por isso cabe-te a ti fazer o melhor com o que encontrares. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/4bb643362d2925a1950009742966fba0.poster.avif?t=1792718193\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/4bb643362d2925a1950009742966fba0.webm?t=1792718193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/4bb643362d2925a1950009742966fba0.mp4?t=1792718193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SAQUEIA,</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Com armas exclusivas, vários mantimentos e ferramentas especiais para superares a astúcia adversária, a maneira como te equipas só depende de ti! Combina as tuas armas favoritas com acessórios poderosos ou arrisca ir atrás de Pacotes de Ajuda bastante disputados para conseguires saque exclusivo e que te dará a vantagem necessária para vencer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/960d991a398e5ab7472f6e7677693968.poster.avif?t=1792718193\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/960d991a398e5ab7472f6e7677693968.webm?t=1792718193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/960d991a398e5ab7472f6e7677693968.mp4?t=1792718193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOBREVIVE</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acumular é só o início. Com a Zona Segura a diminuir cada vez mais com o passar do tempo, o risco de encontrares outros sobreviventes aumenta significativamente. Se morreres, estás fora. Terás de pensar, correr e apontar melhor do que os teus adversários se quiseres ser o último jogador de pé e subir ao pódio.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/fa735ab8c6a53aad70db16bca96549d9.poster.avif?t=1792718193\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/fa735ab8c6a53aad70db16bca96549d9.webm?t=1792718193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/fa735ab8c6a53aad70db16bca96549d9.mp4?t=1792718193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MUITAS FORMAS DE JOGAR,</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aquece num Team Deathmatch, experimenta os modos Arcade em constante mudança, participa no evento sazonal mais recente ou cria o teu lobby personalizado e desafia amigos para algo único. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/83ece2f7635b618bee2c6dd899a13503.poster.avif?t=1792718193\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/83ece2f7635b618bee2c6dd899a13503.webm?t=1792718193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/83ece2f7635b618bee2c6dd899a13503.mp4?t=1792718193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>E CADA JOGO É ÚNICO</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Não existem duas batalhas iguais, e tudo se baseia nas decisões que tomas para aterrar, saquear e sobreviver. Aterra nos Battlegrounds, onde a vitória depende de cada movimento e escolha, e luta para seres o último jogador de pé. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inclui compras opcionais no jogo. </p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/a540542c9e4e836390bfb24a25c205bf.poster.avif?t=1792718193\" width=700 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/a540542c9e4e836390bfb24a25c205bf.webm?t=1792718193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/a540542c9e4e836390bfb24a25c205bf.mp4?t=1792718193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/94748cbaeec0ad3090ce509567b709e9.poster.avif?t=1792718193\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/94748cbaeec0ad3090ce509567b709e9.webm?t=1792718193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/94748cbaeec0ad3090ce509567b709e9.mp4?t=1792718193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ATERRA,</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explora uma seleção de mapas em permanente crescimento e transformação que te vai desafiar constantemente. Vais escolher as periferias mais seguras e arriscar não conseguir saque suficiente ou optarás por aterrar em zonas de conflito nas cidades densas e lutar mal toques no chão? Cada partida é diferente, por isso cabe-te a ti fazer o melhor com o que encontrares. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/4bb643362d2925a1950009742966fba0.poster.avif?t=1792718193\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/4bb643362d2925a1950009742966fba0.webm?t=1792718193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/4bb643362d2925a1950009742966fba0.mp4?t=1792718193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SAQUEIA,</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Com armas exclusivas, vários mantimentos e ferramentas especiais para superares a astúcia adversária, a maneira como te equipas só depende de ti! Combina as tuas armas favoritas com acessórios poderosos ou arrisca ir atrás de Pacotes de Ajuda bastante disputados para conseguires saque exclusivo e que te dará a vantagem necessária para vencer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/960d991a398e5ab7472f6e7677693968.poster.avif?t=1792718193\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/960d991a398e5ab7472f6e7677693968.webm?t=1792718193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/960d991a398e5ab7472f6e7677693968.mp4?t=1792718193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOBREVIVE</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acumular é só o início. Com a Zona Segura a diminuir cada vez mais com o passar do tempo, o risco de encontrares outros sobreviventes aumenta significativamente. Se morreres, estás fora. Terás de pensar, correr e apontar melhor do que os teus adversários se quiseres ser o último jogador de pé e subir ao pódio.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/fa735ab8c6a53aad70db16bca96549d9.poster.avif?t=1792718193\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/fa735ab8c6a53aad70db16bca96549d9.webm?t=1792718193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/fa735ab8c6a53aad70db16bca96549d9.mp4?t=1792718193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MUITAS FORMAS DE JOGAR,</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aquece num Team Deathmatch, experimenta os modos Arcade em constante mudança, participa no evento sazonal mais recente ou cria o teu lobby personalizado e desafia amigos para algo único. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/83ece2f7635b618bee2c6dd899a13503.poster.avif?t=1792718193\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/83ece2f7635b618bee2c6dd899a13503.webm?t=1792718193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/578080/extras/83ece2f7635b618bee2c6dd899a13503.mp4?t=1792718193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>E CADA JOGO É ÚNICO</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Não existem duas batalhas iguais, e tudo se baseia nas decisões que tomas para aterrar, saquear e sobreviver. Aterra nos Battlegrounds, onde a vitória depende de cada movimento e escolha, e luta para seres o último jogador de pé. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inclui compras opcionais no jogo. </p>",
            "short_description": "PUBG: BATTLEGROUNDS, o shooter que deu início à loucura dos Battle Royale e em que o vencedor leva tudo é free-to-play! Explora mapas diversos, saqueia armas e mantimentos exclusivos e sobrevive numa zona que encolhe constantemente, onde cada passo dado pode ser o teu último.",
